{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Both the Drop-in and the Components offer a an option to customize the strings to match the usecase \/ tone of voice your app."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, the SDK attempts to use a device’s locale for translation of text and formatting of monetary values. If the preferred device’s locales are not supported, the SDK falls back to the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"en-US"}]},{"text":" locale.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Localization only picks up locales that are listed in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleLocalizations"},{"text":" property of your app’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" file."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Overriding default formatting of monetary values","level":2,"anchor":"Overriding-default-formatting-of-monetary-values","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To enforce your own formatting for monetary values, use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"locale"},{"text":" property on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizationParameters"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Overriding a string","type":"heading","anchor":"Overriding-a-string"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can override strings for each key, and for each language and locale."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In Xcode, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/library\/archive\/documentation\/Cocoa\/Conceptual\/LoadingResources\/Strings\/Strings.html","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or use your existing "},{"code":"Localizable.strings","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"Localizable.xcstrings","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, if your app uses English and Spanish, your project folder should have a "},{"code":"Localizable.strings","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file for each locale:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"English: "},{"code":"en-US.lproj\/Localizable.string","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Spanish: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"es-ES.lproj\/Localizable.string"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"orderedList","start":2,"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Find the key for the string you want to translate in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-ios\/blob\/develop\/Adyen\/Assets\/Generated\/LocalizationKey.swift","isActive":true},{"text":" and override it for each desired locale:","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, if you want to override the payment button text to "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Subscribe for [AMOUNT]"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"English, in the "},{"code":"en-US.lproj\/Localizable.string","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file:"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["\"adyen.submitButton.formatted\" = \"Subscribe for %@\";"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Spanish, in the "},{"code":"es-ES.lproj\/Localizable.string","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file:"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["\"adyen.submitButton.formatted\" = \"Suscríbete por %@\";"]},{"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you are using multiple Adyen Components or Drop-In, all usages of that localization key get updated with the overridden value.","type":"text"}]}]},{"style":"tip","type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to override the value for a key for a specific component you can use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizationParameters"},{"text":" to specify a custom localization file to get the values from as described below.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Custom-localization-file-name","text":"Custom localization file name","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use a custom localization file name, key format, or bundle, you must configure "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizationParameters"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Parameter","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Default value","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"bundle","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your bundle.","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Bundle.main","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"tableName","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your localization file name."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Localizable.strings","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keySeparator"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The separator for the key for each string.","type":"text"}